  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Back Better and Resilience Building Through Integrated Territorial Approach in Sofala Province, Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed to promote an integrated resilient recovery  through two synergic components: Housing/Services and Agriculture . The activities to be carried out during the inception phase will allow defining both components through specific assessments, mapping and analysis. To build back physical, social and economic infrastructure to reduce the vulnerability of the population exposed to climatic hazards in three districts along the Beira corridor in Sofala Province.</narrative>
  </description>
